WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.780
Before raising a second microphone report, search All Tickets using the equipment or ticket number already supplied.

00:00:06.780 --> 00:00:12.920
In Split view, compare the studio, asset and failure condition, not just two similar titles.

00:00:12.920 --> 00:00:20.010
If the existing record is the same incident, open it and add the new observation to Comments instead of submitting another repair.
